a. The amended provisions of Articles 19(4), 23, 29(1)1, and 30;
b. The amended provisions of Articles 12(2), 19(3), and 22 and the proviso of Article 29(2) (limited to the provisions regarding the Minister of Finance and Economy and the Ministry of Finance and Economy);
